<p>You know, I really like this one. I geniunely had no idea where this was going until the actual launch.</p>
<p>I would like a line in there somewhere about attempting to track/follow the UFO as it leaves. Seems like an interesting avenue of research on this one that isn't mentioned anywhere in the article.</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">I'm not sure how I feel about all the superscripts. I get the appeal, of including relevant data without cluttering the article, but the result was that I kept having to scroll back and forth between the two. Kind of annoying.</span> EDIT: I'm dumb.</p>
